s","title":"Understand earnings status","summary":"Explain the screenshot's Commission Generated, Pending, Available, and Withdrawn fields; note the visible seven-day release statement."},{"id":"referral_records","title":"Review referrals and records","summary":"Describe the visible Referrals tab and sample record fields: joined date, qualifying orders, and order value; do not invent customer data."},{"id":"responsible_sharing","title":"Build trust when you refer","summary":"Encourage clear disclosures, no spam, no guaranteed earnings, and careful privacy practices."},{"id":"support_security","title":"Security and support","summary":"Remind viewers to protect credentials and contact BTECH SMM using verified support details."},{"id":"closing","title":"Share with clarity. Grow with trust.","summary":"Recap the portal workflow and close with website and official support contact."}],"isImageSlides":false,"isPptx":false}}]},"resource_uri":"manus-resource://manus-slides/deck/btech-smm-ambassador-portal-guid-mv3rvs06-d3e26984","widget_uri":"manus-widget://manus-slides/studio/deck/btech-smm-ambassador-portal-guid-mv3rvs06-d3e26984","model_summary":{"project_id":"btech-smm-ambassador-portal-guid-mv3rvs06-d3e26984","project_dir":"C:\\Users\\Becam Aziz\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\BTECH-SMM\\BTECH-SMM\\BTECH SMM MARKETING\\manus-slides\\btech-smm-ambassador-portal-guid-mv3rvs06-d3e26984","active_file":"closing.html","resource_uri":"manus-resource://manus-slides/deck/btech-smm-ambassador-portal-guid-mv3rvs06-d3e26984","base_resource_uri":"manus-resource://manus-slides/deck/btech-smm-ambassador-portal-guid-mv3rvs06-d3e26984","widget_uri":"manus-widget://manus-slides/studio/deck/btech-smm-ambassador-portal-guid-mv3rvs06-d3e26984","base_widget_uri":"manus-widget://manus-slides/studio/deck/btech-smm-ambassador-portal-guid-mv3rvs06-d3e26984","version_id":"v-mv3s05mz-f2b09f40"}},"_meta":{"manus.addon.result/v1":{"schema":"manus.addon.result/v1","addonId":"manus-slides","resources":[{"schema":